license cost that's

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.740
[? commensurate ?] of
the cores that you have.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.980
So we have a couple
of options there.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:09.350
If you need 50
cores or 40 cores,

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.885
whatever, you get
a physical box.

00:11:10.885 --> 00:11:12.260
And then there'll
be some smaller

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.210
ones that use OVM to
virtualize, so you

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:16.170
can get two or four cores.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.990
We also have the ability to
configure all of our databases

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.470
within Oracle Grid and
Oracle RAC configuration.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.190
So you can have two nodes,
three nodes, four nodes.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.907
Again, that's there for
HA, as well as performance.

00:11:27.907 --> 00:11:29.990
So that's a little bit of
the functional overview.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:32.420
