just keep that in mind.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.408
But we wanted to make sure
that we showed a comparison.

00:11:41.408 --> 00:11:43.700
If you've got an Oracle
database that's running on-prem

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.890
and you're considering
moving it to the Cloud,

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.057
if you were to move to one
of the other public Cloud

00:11:48.057 --> 00:11:51.740
providers, that 12 core
