00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:20.960
So then, as far as how we
deployed in US East 4 right

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:24.170
now, as I said earlier, we've
got two management RACKs

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:27.440
for redundancy to ensure
that we have availability.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.420
We use all HPE hardware
in our environment,

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:31.970
so we've got Nimble Storage.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:37.100
Everything comes with
solid state storage,

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.660
both on the physical side,
