RACK that we all

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.740
manage to segregate network
between the different workflows

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:58.055
that are running
on the environment.

00:12:58.055 --> 00:12:59.666
Can we move on?

00:12:59.666 --> 00:13:01.140
