Oracle, and the other one

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.300
is individual VMware guests.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:16.740
Because this is our own hardware
and it's physical bare-metal,

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:20.790
we're able to host any workload
that can run on an x86 chipset

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:23.980
