interested in this solution.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.300
So the first one we'll
talk about a little bit

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.763
is SAP environments.

00:13:37.763 --> 00:13:39.180
So what we're
showing here is kind

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:44.040
of four landscapes that cover
production, test, QA, and DR--

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.950
four SAP landscapes
that we can deploy.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.290
Obviously, the
small and the medium

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:52.080
