run in GCP right now.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.810
You're certified up
to 4 terabyte HANA.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.253
I think 6 terabytes is coming
this summer and 8 in the fall.

00:13:58.253 --> 00:13:59.670
What's interesting
